====== MikroTik RB5009UG+S+IN ======

The MikroTik RB5009UG+S+IN is a compact multigig router based on Marvell's Armada 7040 ARM64 SoC. It comes with an SFP+ port, one 2.5 GbE port (with PoE+ in) and 7 GbE ports. It can be wall mounted or rack mounted with the [[https://mikrotik.com/product/rb5009_mount|MikroTik K-79 rackmount kit]].

